              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Matka gambling is a betting and lottery form historically using randomly drawn slips or playing cards to generate winning numbers."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The practice developed from cotton-rate betting in India and later used random numbers drawn from a matka pot or from playing-card procedures."
            }
          ]
        },
